{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40508","headline":"长城 · 苏拯","name":"长城","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"嬴氏设防胡，烝沙筑冤垒。\n蒙公取勳名，岂算生民死。\n运畚力不禁，碎身砂碛里。\n黔黎欲半空，长城舂未已。\n皇天潜鼓怒，力化一女子。\n遂使万雉崩，不尽数行泪。\n自古进身者，本非陷物致。\n当时文德修，不到三世地。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"苏拯","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_40508.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40508","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}